==Slovene==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sl|sla-pro|*xlěbъ}}, from a {{der|sl|gem}} language. Compare {{cog|got|𐌷𐌻𐌰𐌹𐍆𐍃}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sl-IPA|hlẹ̑b|hlȅb}}

===Noun===
{{sl-noun|hlẹ̑b|head2=hlȅb|m-in}}

# {{lb|sl|literary}} [[loaf]] (of bread)
# {{lb|sl|literary}} [[lump]], [[piece]] (of anything else)
# {{lb|sl|dated}} [[bread]] generally

====Usage notes====
Note that {{l|sl|kruh}} means bread and ''hleb'' is used as "a loaf of bread" (unlike other Slavic languages).

